silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_03_sections_02_concrete_anchor_5#measurementdate2026_05_10 silm:hasLongDescription "The MeasurementDate2026_05_10 is the 2026-05-10 measurement timestamp. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Date_2', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
